Subject: [PATCH 7/8] feat(repos): add list_repository_files and get_files

list_repository_files lists every file of a repository in one call
(recursive tree, optional directory filter, max_entries cap, sizes
only). get_files reads up to 25 text files in one call with a total
byte cap, reporting per-file problems instead of failing the call.
Both are in the default repos toolset.

